  "content": "<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Se vienen los eventos gastronomicos de invierno y bajo la Lluvia torrencial de emociones</h2>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12497\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/s0hjo8xgj9mq7sm/promo_01_1024x1024_xnvfj4s7r0.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12496\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/2pvtv3ykxu391hj/promo_22_1_1024x683_x6vqxfu0ha.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🎉\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8c/1/16/1f389.png\"/> Ya se encuentran disponibles las Bases de Postulación para los stands de “Costumbres Bajo la Lluvia 2026” CARELMAPU 29 DE AGOSTO DE 2026</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"🙌\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfd/1/16/1f64c.png\"/> Invitamos a todos los emprendedores de la comuna a participar y ser parte de esta tradicional actividad.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📄\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfd/1/16/1f4c4.png\"/> Lee atentamente las Bases de Postulación, revisa los requisitos y condiciones, y recuerda respetar las fechas y plazos establecidos para presentar tu postulación.</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">LINK: <a href=\"https://munimaullin.cl/documents/bases-de-postulacion-para-los-stands-de-costumbres-bajo-la-lluvia-2026-carelmapu-29-de-agosto-de-2026/?fbclid=IwcGRvZgVleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETFUSG5zMVdUdTZJUlBZTEdhc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHqD9Tdk0Pb-Jw3vwxqEqIQA8PcBWcemOrgcH6tWLxVTdOLBUxETivGru2OCI_aem_81RXuufFualjjXCxHO6Rqw\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://munimaullin.cl/…/bases-de-postulacion-para-los…/</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"📌\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tac/1/16/1f4cc.png\"/> ¡No dejes pasar esta oportunidad y participa de Costumbres Bajo la Lluvia 2026!</p>\r\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">fuente comunicaciones y fomento productivo DIDECO munimaullin.cl</p>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12485\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/r95b8iqy6a3rcsk/promo_11_1024x683_zc5ylhgly4.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12471\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://bd.maullinultimobastion.cl/api/files/pbc_1081480210/zqaqxdvxcngbacm/promo_02_1024x683_97g1xf5us9.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"/></figure>\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-33 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\r\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image